+// For a game that backs its TLB-mapped (KUSEG) addresses itself: virtual_to_physical gives osVirtualToPhysical a mapped
+// address's physical one (0xFFFFFFFF for one it doesn't map, which is then returned as it is), and before_rsp_task runs
+// on the game's thread as a task is submitted, before the RSP reads memory, to put what the game wrote through a mapping
+// where the RSP reads it. Either may be null.
